{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL09uZGluZSUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Ondine","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rQSQisWjIjXnGGenrpjG1GlQcRf.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myYFabjrPz1Gbt3bB3GnEo6OlSN.jpg","description":"On the coast of Cork, Syracuse is a divorced fisherman who has stopped drinking. His precocious daughter Annie has failing kidneys. One day, he finds a nearly-drowned young woman in his net; she calls herself Ondine and wants no one to see her. He puts her up in an isolated cottage that was his mother's. Annie discovers Ondine's presence and believes she is a selkie, a seal that turns human while on land. Syracuse is afraid to hope again.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Drama","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.4","runtime":"111 min","cast":["Colin Farrell","Alicja Bachleda-Curuś","Dervla Kirwan","Alison Barry","Marion O'Dwyer","Tony Curran","Mary O'Shea","Gemma Reeves"],"director":["Neil Jordan"],"released":"2010-03-05T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The truth is not what you know. It's what you believe.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Colin Farrell","character":"Syracuse","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5FdalJbrbZ5UCsED5rFrXpvbqJa.jpg"},{"name":"Alicja Bachleda-Curuś","character":"Ondine","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ojL25lx4zeHccDDdM6r78L5Vnxw.jpg"},{"name":"Dervla Kirwan","character":"Maura","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6ZReeKzRaWMDzlfRbJcqelAfPZ6.jpg"},{"name":"Alison Barry","character":"Annie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aLizVaMQO1E9XxGvEzX4oZ447Tr.jpg"},{"name":"Marion O'Dwyer","character":"Nurse - Dialysis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rBWpMQohUabjRTuvENWEiHyKjx1.jpg"},{"name":"Tony Curran","character":"Alex","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s50kh2ubcoCV6rvXobebvcyNALE.jpg"},{"name":"Mary O'Shea","character":"Fish Co Op Worker"},{"name":"Gemma Reeves","character":"Draper's Shop